  "summary": "The SIMAI Framework Pro Smart components, the component package pro (owner decision q-4ac7d07595, 2026-11-02: one package name, pro; Larena is one consumer among others). They are built from the component folder in simai/ui-pro by the Framework builder over a pinned ui-source revision (standard simai.component-package) and published as releases of simai/ui-pro. A page loads them as a component package of the Loader: SF_BOOT_CONFIG.packages.pro = {base: '<package base>'}. This file names them, and what each needs, so the free registry can place them in the one free recipe that still names them; it carries no bytes and grants nothing. An element renamed with a dated tag alias (rename plan R2, 2026-11-03) lists each former tag in element_aliases, with its dates and its change journal record; the package rule lists the element first and its former tags after it, and the Smart base defines each former tag beside it until remove_after. The former name larena stays a dated alias (larena.package.json, the Loader's packages.larena, journal record option-package-larena-to-pro) until 2027-01-01.",
